WEBVTT

00:03:28.236 --> 00:03:31.436
unless we rewild our planet.

00:03:32.836 --> 00:03:37.516
If we are to prevent a global disaster,
we need to do two things.

00:03:37.876 --> 00:03:42.836
As we know, we need to reduce emissions
of greenhouse gases to almost zero.

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:46.516
But we also need to draw down
the excess carbon pollution

00:03:46.556 --> 00:03:48.996
in the atmosphere and in the ocean.

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.596
How can we do that?

00:03:52.276 --> 00:03:56.796
To capture the excess of greenhouse gases,
we need nature's help.

00:03:57.716 --> 00:03:59.476
Because trees,

00:03:59.516 --> 00:04:03.836
grasslands, peatlands, mangroves,